Blitz
Origin: https://github.com/DioxusLabs/blitz
Release: v0.3.0-beta.4
Commit: 92b11f1bd8ab7975411328b0406a95a09445b4e7
Licence: MIT OR Apache-2.0 (we use Apache-2.0).
Use: pinned dependencies blitz-dom, blitz-html, blitz-paint, blitz-traits and
stylo_taffy. crates/isr/src/main.rs adapts offscreen scene construction and PNG
encoding from examples/screenshot.rs. DOM traversal and rectangle inspection
